(5 ml) was stirred in the presence of BiCl3 (1.25 mmole) and the alcohol
(1.25 mmole) at 25°C (or reflux) under nitrogen atmosphere. The reaction
was followed by GC until complete alcohol consumption. The mixture was
filtered and solvent evaporation led to chlorides in the yields shown.
