7.58 (d, J = 7.9Hz, 2H), 7.48-7.41 (m, 3H), 7.16 (s, 1H), 4.29 (s, 2H);
IR (KBr): 2963, 2855, 2210, 1891, 1602, 1510, 1417, 1246, 1169 cm-1; MS
(EI): m/z 195 [M+], 160, 140, 133, 120; GC: Z:E = 10:90.
